OneiOS take18, userland/metal/patches/metal2vulkan/0003: an indirect pointer without pointee metadata is reflected as
Metal does.
Upstream: Droid-VM/macOS-DroidVM fec8a28 (lateautumn233, 2026-11-13: patches/metal2vulkan-macos/0004), as Droid-VM/UniXNU
wip/hackintosh patches/metal2vulkan/0041-opaque-indirect-pointer-reflection.patch; applies here with a 9-line offset
(contexts made again).
What: a buffer argument that is no argument buffer and has no layout, size or alignment in AIR is reflected as a pointer
to None with zero size and alignment (Metal's own representation) instead of refusing the pipeline's whole reflection.
Why: macOS-DroidVM: Weather made its pipelines without the reflection refusals after it ("foreground Weather creates its
pipelines without the previous reflection refusals").
Switch: none. Removable: yes (ONEIOS_METAL_SKIP=opaque-indirect-pointer-reflection).

diff --git a/crates/metal2vulkan/src/reflection/derive.rs b/crates/metal2vulkan/src/reflection/derive.rs
index ebd79bd..15b64e1 100644
--- a/crates/metal2vulkan/src/reflection/derive.rs
+++ b/crates/metal2vulkan/src/reflection/derive.rs
@@ -589,8 +589,20 @@ impl Cx<'_> {
                     ParamRole::Sampler { .. } => (DataType::Sampler, TypeDetail::Plain),
                     ParamRole::Buffer(b) | ParamRole::ArgumentBuffer(b) => {
                         let nested = matches!(ia.role, ParamRole::ArgumentBuffer(_));
-                        let (size, align) = self.size_align(arg, &ia.ty)?;
-                        let (pointee, detail) = self.pointee(arg, &ia.ty, b.layout, nested)?;
+                        // AIR may retain an indirect pointer without any pointee metadata.
+                        // Metal reflects it as None with zero size/alignment and no struct,
+                        // while preserving the other argument-buffer members.
+                        let (size, align, pointee, detail) = if !nested
+                            && b.layout.is_none()
+                            && ia.ty.size.is_none()
+                            && ia.ty.align.is_none()
+                        {
+                            (0, 0, DataType::None, TypeDetail::Plain)
+                        } else {
+                            let (size, align) = self.size_align(arg, &ia.ty)?;
+                            let (pointee, detail) = self.pointee(arg, &ia.ty, b.layout, nested)?;
+                            (size, align, pointee, detail)
+                        };
                         let pointer = PointerType::new(
                             pointee,
                             binding_access(b.access),
